<title>SINGAPORE: Auric Pacific H1 net profit jumps.</title>
<headline>Auric Pacific H1 net profit jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1.90   vs   0.57</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (cts)	  1.53   vs   0.46</p>
<p>    Turnover			    169.48   vs 160.64</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  2.72   vs   0.31</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  7.68   vs   7.10</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		    nil   vs   3.48</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			4.14   vs   4.07</p>
<p>    Tax				     2.68   vs   2.96</p>
<p>    Minority interest	  (gain) 0.44   vs   0.54 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Auric Pacific Group Ltd is a food manufacturer and distributor.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
